{"id":"vod_bf_13074","vodId":"13074","provider":"bf","providerName":"暴风资源","type":2,"name":"黑执事第一季","name_cn":"黑执事第一季","date":"2008-01-01","year":"2008","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"更新至第24集","images":{"common":"https://img.bfzypic.com/upload/vod/20230424-14/7011b65d0ef74c6162dd94e56265b3e8.jpg"},"summary":"时值19世纪，在英国名门贵族凡多姆海伍家，有一位神秘、优雅、十全十美的执事，他就是“黑执事” 塞巴斯蒂安。虽然塞巴斯蒂安总是淡淡地说： “我只是一名执事罢了”，但举止、知识、品味、料理、武术等等没有任何事能难得倒他！塞巴斯蒂安的主人，是年仅12岁就位居凡多姆海伍家族的当主——夏尔。夏尔不仅只花了短短3年的时间，就让凡多姆公司成为英国最大的零食玩具制造商，更在台面下为女王执行秘密任务，因此又被称为“邪恶贵族”！塞巴斯蒂安除了负责照顾谢尔的日常生活起居之外，还得帮成事不足、败事有余的家仆们收拾善后。最重要的是，塞巴斯蒂安必须因应谢尔各种任性的要求，优雅达成不可能的任务！“身为 凡多姆海恩家的执事，怎能连这点小事也办不到？”为了主人夏尔，塞巴斯蒂安将尽心服侍、实现主人所有的愿望。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"奇幻,推理,日韩动漫"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2025-04-02 20:18:23","playable":true,"episodeCount":25,"classic":true,"classicRank":118,"franchise":"黑执事","playGroups":[{"name":"bfzym3u8","episodes":[{"name":"OVA","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/heizhishidiyiji/OVA/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第01集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/heizhishidiyiji/第01集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/heizhishidiyiji/第02集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/heizhishidiyiji/第03集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/heizhishidiyiji/第04集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/heizhishidiyiji/第05集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/heizhishidiyiji/第06集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/heizhishidiyiji/第07集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/heizhishidiyiji/第08集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/heizhishidiyiji/第09集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/heizhishidiyiji/第10集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/heizhishidiyiji/第11集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/vide